---
/**
 * ============================================================================
 * QUÉ HACE:
 * Ventana flotante (Modal) del módulo `checkout-whatsapp` para GoManía SpA.
 * - Paso 1: Solicita 3 datos obligatorios (Nombre y apellido, Correo electrónico
 *   y Dirección de domicilio) y explica la coordinación + envío del código de
 *   seguimiento por correo y WhatsApp.
 * - Paso 2: Confirmación modal antes de vaciar el carrito tras abrir WhatsApp.
 *
 * CON QUÉ MÓDULO CONECTA:
 * - Montado en `src/pages/index.astro` dentro de `#slot-checkout`.
 * - Escucha `gomania:irACheckout` disparado por `CarritoDrawer`.
 * - Emite `checkout:pedidoCompletado` vía `EventBus` al confirmar el envío.
 * ============================================================================
 */
---

<div
  id="gm-checkout-modal"
  class="gm-checkout-root"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="gm-checkout-title"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="gm-checkout-overlay" data-checkout-overlay></div>

  <div class="gm-checkout-dialog">
    <header class="gm-checkout-header">
      <div class="gm-checkout-header-left">
        <span class="gm-checkout-wa-badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91C21.95 6.45 17.5 2 12.04 2Zm5.76 14.01c-.24.68-1.4 1.3-1.94 1.38-.49.08-1.12.11-1.81-.11-.42-.13-.96-.31-1.65-.61-2.9-1.25-4.79-4.18-4.94-4.37-.14-.2-1.18-1.57-1.18-2.99 0-1.42.74-2.12 1.01-2.41.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.19 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.24.58.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.52-.1.2-.15.32-.3.49-.15.17-.31.38-.44.51-.15.15-.3.31-.13.61.17.3.77 1.27 1.65 2.06 1.14 1.01 2.09 1.33 2.39 1.48.3.15.47.12.64-.07.17-.2.74-.86.94-1.16.2-.3.4-.25.67-.15.27.1 1.73.82 2.02.96.3.15.49.22.56.34.07.13.07.72-.17 1.4Z" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h2 id="gm-checkout-title">Finalizar compra por WhatsApp</h2>
          <p class="gm-checkout-summary" data-checkout-summary>0 bolsas · $0</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="gm-checkout-close"
        data-checkout-close
        aria-label="Cerrar ventana de compra"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18" />
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </header>

    {/* PASO 1: FORMULARIO DE 3 INPUTS */}
    <div class="gm-checkout-body" data-checkout-step="form">
      <div class="gm-checkout-info">
        <p>
          <strong>Coordinación por WhatsApp:</strong> Completa tus datos para enviarnos tu pedido.
          Al terminar la compra por WhatsApp, el <strong>código de seguimiento</strong> que le entreguen
          a GoManía será enviado a tu <strong>correo electrónico y WhatsApp</strong> para que veas el estado de tu pedido.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form class="gm-checkout-form" data-checkout-form novalidate>
        {/* Campo honeypot anti-bots */}
        <input
          type="text"
          name="empresa"
          tabindex="-1"
          autocomplete="off"
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="gm-checkout-honeypot"
          data-checkout-honeypot
        />

        <div class="gm-checkout-field">
          <label for="gm-chk-nombre">Nombre y apellido *</label>
          <input
            id="gm-chk-nombre"
            type="text"
            name="nombre"
            required
            autocomplete="name"
            placeholder="Ej. Camila Rojas"
            data-checkout-nombre
          />
          <p class="gm-checkout-error" data-checkout-error="nombre" hidden></p>
        </div>

        <div class="gm-checkout-field">
          <label for="gm-chk-correo">Correo electrónico *</label>
          <input
            id="gm-chk-correo"
            type="email"
            name="correo"
            required
            autocomplete="email"
            placeholder="Ej. camila@correo.cl"
            data-checkout-correo
          />
          <p class="gm-checkout-error" data-checkout-error="correo" hidden></p>
        </div>

        <div class="gm-checkout-field">
          <label for="gm-chk-direccion">Dirección de tu domicilio *</label>
          <input
            id="gm-chk-direccion"
            type="text"
            name="direccion"
            required
            autocomplete="street-address"
            placeholder="Ej. Av. España 1234, Depto 5B, Valparaíso"
            data-checkout-direccion
          />
          <p class="gm-checkout-error" data-checkout-error="direccion" hidden></p>
        </div>

        <div class="gm-checkout-actions">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="gm-checkout-btn-secondary"
            data-checkout-cancel
          >
            Cancelar
          </button>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="gm-checkout-btn-whatsapp"
            data-checkout-submit
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91C21.95 6.45 17.5 2 12.04 2Zm5.76 14.01c-.24.68-1.4 1.3-1.94 1.38-.49.08-1.12.11-1.81-.11-.42-.13-.96-.31-1.65-.61-2.9-1.25-4.79-4.18-4.94-4.37-.14-.2-1.18-1.57-1.18-2.99 0-1.42.74-2.12 1.01-2.41.27-.29.58-.36.78-.36.19 0 .39 0 .56.01.18.01.42-.07.66.5.24.58.83 2.02.9 2.17.07.15.12.32.02.52-.1.2-.15.32-.3.49-.15.17-.31.38-.44.51-.15.15-.3.31-.13.61.17.3.77 1.27 1.65 2.06 1.14 1.01 2.09 1.33 2.39 1.48.3.15.47.12.64-.07.17-.2.74-.86.94-1.16.2-.3.4-.25.67-.15.27.1 1.73.82 2.02.96.3.15.49.22.56.34.07.13.07.72-.17 1.4Z" />
            </svg>
            <span data-checkout-submit-label>Enviar pedido por WhatsApp</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    {/* PASO 2: CONFIRMACIÓN MODAL ANTES DE VACIAR EL CARRITO */}
    <div class="gm-checkout-body gm-checkout-confirm" data-checkout-step="confirm" hidden>
      <div class="gm-checkout-confirm-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14" />
          <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <span class="gm-checkout-folio" data-checkout-folio hidden></span>
      <h3 class="gm-checkout-confirm-title">¿Ya enviaste tu pedido por WhatsApp?</h3>
      <p class="gm-checkout-confirm-desc" data-checkout-confirm-desc></p>

      <div class="gm-checkout-confirm-helpers">
        <a
          href="#"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="gm-checkout-link-btn"
          data-checkout-reopen-wa
        >
          Abrir WhatsApp de nuevo
        </a>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="gm-checkout-link-btn"
          data-checkout-copy
        >
          Copiar mensaje del pedido
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="gm-checkout-actions gm-checkout-actions--confirm">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="gm-checkout-btn-secondary"
          data-checkout-back
        >
          Volver / Mantener carrito
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          class="gm-checkout-btn-whatsapp"
          data-checkout-finish
        >
          Sí, ya lo envié (finalizar)
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  import { initCheckoutModal } from './checkout-modal.client';
  initCheckoutModal();
</script>

<style is:global>
  .gm-checkout-scroll-lock {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .gm-checkout-root {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1300;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px;
    pointer-events: none;
    visibility: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.22s ease, visibility 0.22s ease;
  }

  .gm-checkout-root.is-open {
    pointer-events: auto;
    visibility: visible;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .gm-checkout-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.62);
    backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
  }

  .gm-checkout-dialog {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    max-height: min(92dvh, 720px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--bg-surface, #FFFFFF);
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
    border: var(--border-width, 1px) solid var(--border-color, rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.12));
    box-shadow: 0 24px 56px rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.28);
    transform: translateY(14px) scale(0.97);
    transition: transform 0.24s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .gm-checkout-root.is-open .gm-checkout-dialog {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }

  .gm-checkout-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    background: var(--bg-canvas, #F4F8FB);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.08);
  }

  .gm-checkout-header-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .gm-checkout-wa-badge {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #16A34A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .gm-checkout-header h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Fredoka', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
  }

  .gm-checkout-summary {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-pink, #F44870);
  }

  .gm-checkout-close {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.06);
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background 0.16s ease;
  }

  .gm-checkout-close:hover {
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.12);
  }

  .gm-checkout-body {
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .gm-checkout-body[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .gm-checkout-info {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #ECFDF5;
    border: 1px solid #A7F3D0;
    color: #065F46;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .gm-checkout-info p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gm-checkout-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .gm-checkout-honeypot {
    position: absolute;
    left: -9999px;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .gm-checkout-field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .gm-checkout-field label {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
  }

  .gm-checkout-field input {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.16);
    background: var(--bg-canvas, #F4F8FB);
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    transition: border-color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease;
  }

  .gm-checkout-field input:focus {
    outline: none;
    background: var(--bg-surface, #FFFFFF);
    border-color: var(--brand-sky, #28AAE1);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-sky, #28AAE1) 20%, transparent);
  }

  .gm-checkout-field input[aria-invalid='true'] {
    border-color: var(--state-error, #BE123C);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--state-error, #BE123C) 14%, transparent);
  }

  .gm-checkout-error {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--state-error, #BE123C);
  }

  .gm-checkout-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column-reverse;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 480px) {
    .gm-checkout-actions {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  .gm-checkout-btn-secondary,
  .gm-checkout-btn-whatsapp {
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 11px 16px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Fredoka', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.16s ease, transform 0.14s ease, opacity 0.16s ease;
  }

  .gm-checkout-btn-secondary {
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.16);
    background: var(--bg-surface, #FFFFFF);
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
  }

  .gm-checkout-btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--bg-canvas, #F4F8FB);
  }

  .gm-checkout-btn-whatsapp {
    flex: 1;
    border: 0;
    background: #16A34A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .gm-checkout-btn-whatsapp:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: #15803D;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .gm-checkout-btn-whatsapp:disabled {
    opacity: 0.65;
    cursor: wait;
  }

  /* Paso 2: Confirmación */
  .gm-checkout-confirm {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .gm-checkout-confirm-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #DCFCE7;
    color: #15803D;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .gm-checkout-folio {
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--brand-pink-soft, #FFE5EC);
    color: var(--brand-pink-dark, #D63059);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .gm-checkout-confirm-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Fredoka', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
  }

  .gm-checkout-confirm-desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted, #4B5563);
  }

  .gm-checkout-confirm-helpers {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .gm-checkout-link-btn {
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.14);
    background: var(--bg-canvas, #F4F8FB);
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .gm-checkout-link-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-sky, #28AAE1);
    background: var(--brand-sky-soft, #E6F7FE);
  }

  .gm-checkout-actions--confirm {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
